    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">4 Maintenance</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4;">Since its component park have a long-time stability, the temperature sensor is maintenance-free. Except for occasional visual checks no maintenance measures have to be performed.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4;">Spare parts</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4;">The temperature sensor is not exposed to wear. Therefore, no spare parts are required.</p>
    </div>

