            <div style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.6;">
                <p>Temperature sensor</p>
                <p>Resistance element: Pt 100 in accordance with EN 60751, class A, 2-wire connection</p>
                <p>Error limit: At 0 °C &le; 0.15 K; at 100 °C &le; 0.35 K</p>
                <p>Measuring range: -40 ... +140 °C (with transmitter max. 85 °C)</p>
                <p>Response time: approx. 20 s</p>
                <p>Half-value time: according to VDE/VDI 3511 (with heat transfer compound approximately 10 s)</p>
                <p>Insulation voltage: max. 250 V DC</p>
                <p>Welding collar: stainless steel 1.4571 (AISI 316-Ti)</p>
